LASTVERS name[.cy[,drv]] [/option]
  name:   name of Pascal source file
        option: /f: force compilation
  default drive is 1

  This is a helper program for COMPILE. It rejects
  the COMPILE command if an object file (:R) exists
  on one of the two drives with a equal or higher
  version than the source. In that case compilation
  is aborted unless it is forced with the /f option.